  "solution": {
    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ....(i)<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;....(ii)<br /><br />For equation (ii),&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>23</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br />Roots are complex conjugates.<br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>&#8658;</mo> </mrow> </math>&nbsp;Both roots are common in equation (i) and (ii).<br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>&#8756;&#160;&#160;&#160;</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mtext>a</mtext> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mtext>b</mtext> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>3</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mtext>c</mtext> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>4</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>&#8658;&#160;a</mtext><mtext>&#160;:&#160;</mtext><mtext>b</mtext><mtext>&#160;:&#160;</mtext><mtext>c</mtext><mtext>&#160;: :&#160;</mtext><mn>2</mn><mtext>&#160;:&#160;</mtext><mn>3</mn><mtext>&#160;:&#160;</mtext><mn>4</mn></math>"
